{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["猶大王烏西雅、約坦、亞哈斯和希西迦執政期間，亞摩斯的兒子以賽亞看到了以下有關猶大和耶路撒冷的異象。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝責備叛逆的子民"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"諸天啊，請聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地啊，要側耳聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我把孩子撫育成人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們竟然背叛我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牛認識主人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"驢也認得主人的槽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列卻不認識我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民卻不明白。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"唉！這罪惡的民族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡貫滿盈的百姓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作惡的子孫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敗壞的兒女！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們背棄耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藐視以色列的聖者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與祂疏遠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"你們為什麼一再叛逆？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們為什麼還要受責打？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們已經頭破血流，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"身心疲憊不堪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們已經體無完膚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從頭到腳傷痕纍纍，盡是瘀腫和傷口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有清洗，沒有包紮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有敷藥。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"你們的土地荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城邑化為灰燼。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們親眼目睹自己的田園被外族人侵吞、毀壞、變成不毛之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"僅存的少女錫安也像葡萄園裡的草棚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像瓜田中的茅舍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像被困無援的孤城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不是萬軍之耶和華讓我們一些人存活，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們早就像所多瑪和蛾摩拉一樣滅亡了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你們這些所多瑪的首領啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聆聽耶和華的話！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們這些蛾摩拉的百姓啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要側耳聽我們上帝的訓誨！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你們獻上許多祭物，對我有什麼用呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我厭煩公綿羊的燔祭和肥畜的脂肪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不喜歡公牛、羊羔和公山羊的血。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"「你們來朝見我的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰要求你們帶著這些來踐踏我的院宇呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要再帶毫無意義的祭物了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我憎惡你們燒的香。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我無法容忍你們又作惡又舉行莊嚴的聚會，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是你們的朔日","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"、安息日和大會。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我憎惡你們的朔日及各種節期，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它們成了我的重擔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"令我厭倦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們舉手禱告，我必掩面不理。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你們禱告再多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不會聽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們雙手沾滿鮮血。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要洗淨自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要讓我再看見你們的惡行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要停止作惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要學習行善，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追求正義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"幫助受欺壓的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"替孤兒辯護，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為寡婦伸冤。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「來吧，我們彼此理論！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的罪雖如朱紅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必潔白如雪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的罪雖如緋紅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必白如羊毛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你們願意聽從，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必享用這地方的美好出產。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你們執意叛逆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必喪身刀下。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華親口說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忠信的城竟變成了妓女！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從前充滿公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是公義之家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在卻住著兇手。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的銀子變為渣滓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的美酒摻了水份。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的首領是叛逆之徒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與盜賊為伍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"個個喜愛賄賂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"貪圖好處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不為孤兒辯護，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不替寡婦伸冤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"所以，主——萬軍之耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的大能者說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「唉！我要向我的敵人報仇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向我的仇敵雪恨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必出手攻擊你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用鹼煉淨你的渣滓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除盡你的雜質。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必像從前一樣恢復你的審判官，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像起初一樣恢復你的謀士。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"之後，你必被稱為公義之城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忠信之邑。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"耶和華必因祂的公正救贖錫安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必因祂的公義拯救城中悔改的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但叛逆之輩和犯罪之徒必同遭毀滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背棄耶和華的人必滅亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必因所喜愛的聖橡樹而抱愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必因所選擇的偶像園而蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必像葉子枯萎的橡樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如無水的園子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有權勢的人像麻絨，他的行為如火花，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"兩者要一同焚毀，無人能救。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"「朔日」即每月初一。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/SNG/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}